WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:03.663
- [Narrator] This Great Big
Story was made possible by IBM.

00:00:07.305 --> 00:00:10.388
(upbeat piano music)

00:00:29.620 --> 00:00:30.453
- [Narrator] Welcome to

00:00:30.453 --> 00:00:31.740
- [Together] Girls Coding!

00:00:33.430 --> 00:00:34.790
- [Narrator] And this Abisoye.

00:00:34.790 --> 00:00:36.750
She created an initiative called,

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:38.602
you guessed it, Girls Coding.

00:00:38.602 --> 00:00:41.690
(upbeat piano music)

00:00:41.690 --> 00:00:43.620
It's aimed at teaching
girls from disadvantaged

00:00:43.620 --> 00:00:46.033
backgrounds in Nigeria how to program.

00:01:13.061 --> 00:01:15.330
- [Narrator] It started back in 2015.

00:01:15.330 --> 00:01:16.680
Since then, they've been able to

00:01:16.680 --> 00:01:18.807
teach coding to over 420 girls.

00:01:34.798 --> 00:01:36.750
(clapping)

00:01:36.750 --> 00:01:39.180
- [Narrator] Girls come from
all sorts of backgrounds.

00:01:39.180 --> 00:01:41.520
Many come from the slums around Lagos.

00:01:41.520 --> 00:01:43.280
The majority grow up thinking that

00:01:43.280 --> 00:01:45.433
education isn't an option for them.

00:01:59.833 --> 00:02:00.666
- [Narrator] But a few times

00:02:00.666 --> 00:02:02.540
a week when they join this class,

00:02:02.540 --> 00:02:04.683
they get a glimpse of a whole other world.

00:02:14.212 --> 00:02:18.545
You want to stabilize or
you want to solve problems.

00:02:58.268 --> 00:03:01.768
(upbeat orchestral music)

00:03:03.940 --> 00:03:06.523
(note chiming)

